// Eight-concept motive. The C peer ranks. This board only flows.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE sense  ROLE observer   PROTON 1
CUBE memory ROLE kernel_sot PROTON 1
CUBE plan   ROLE creator    PROTON 1
CUBE act    ROLE construct  PROTON 1
CUBE we     ROLE nexuscore  PROTON 1
CUBE body   ROLE nanobot    PROTON 1

PLUG sense memory
PLUG memory plan
PLUG plan act
PLUG act we
PLUG we body

FOLDBITS memory "11110000111100001111000011110000"
IMPULSE sense 1
IMPULSE memory 1
IMPULSE we 1
IMPULSE body 1
ENERGYFLOW 4
FLOW 2
HARMONY we
DECIDE we
ASSERT CUBES >= 6
PRINT "motive" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
